# Per-sweep code snapshots written by experiment.runlsf (see SNAPSHOT_PATHS); machine-local.
.tmpcode/
# No trailing slash: on the cluster outdir is a symlink to /nrs, which "outdir/" (directories only) wouldn't match, so jj
# would snapshot it and then delete it on the next `jj new` (jrun.sh), leaving submitall to recreate a real outdir/ in home.
outdir
# Local analysis output (figures, tables, summaries), written by reports/; not committed.
# results/perf_journey.html stays tracked: it's the hand-written page perf_journey() fills in.
results/
# The served site (serve.sh, reports/index.py): an index, and links to results/ and outdir/.
site/
# Machine-local cache of expensive-to-compute values (experiment.lejepa_n_params).
.cache/
Claude.md
